WEBVTT

00:09.379 --> 00:10.620
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.689 --> 00:12.517
KIDS:
Aye, aye, Captain!
儿童：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.689 --> 00:14.034
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:14.206 --> 00:15.793
[ louder]:
Aye, aye, Captain!
[更大声]：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.965 --> 00:18.793
♪ Oh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:18.965 --> 00:20.862
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.068 --> 00:22.827
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:23.000 --> 00:25.172
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:25.379 --> 00:26.896
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:27.068 --> 00:28.965
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:29.172 --> 00:30.689
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:30.862 --> 00:33.000
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:33.206 --> 00:35.000
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:35.172 --> 00:36.896
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.965 --> 00:39.896
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:39.965 --> 00:41.137
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:41.310 --> 00:43.241
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:43.413 --> 00:46.827
[ laughs heartily]
[开怀大笑]

00:47.000 --> 00:49.206
[ plays airy tune]
[演奏轻快的曲子]

00:49.379 --> 00:50.793
Captioning sponsored
by MTV NETWORKS
字幕赞助
由 MTV 网络提供

01:02.931 --> 01:04.724
[ banging on door]
[敲门]

01:04.793 --> 01:08.896
Mr. Krabs, some guy in a suit
wants to come in before we open.
蟹老板，一个穿西装的家伙
想在我们开门之前进来。

01:08.965 --> 01:10.793
What? Guy in a suit?
什么？穿西装的家伙？

01:10.965 --> 01:12.965
No! It's a tax collector!
不！原来是个税吏啊！

01:13.137 --> 01:15.344
Hide us, SpongeBob!
隐藏我们，海绵宝宝！

01:15.827 --> 01:20.379
KRABS [ muffled]:
Now we'll walk nonchalantly
to the rear exit.
螃蟹[闷闷不乐]：
现在我们要漫不经心地走
到后出口。

01:22.551 --> 01:23.689
He's got a card.
他有一张卡。

01:23.862 --> 01:26.965
"R.A. PennyPincher
Vending Supplies."
“R.A.彭尼平彻
自动售货用品。”

01:27.137 --> 01:28.206
KRABS:
What?!
螃蟹：
什么？！

01:28.379 --> 01:29.896
My machine has arrived?!
我的机器到了？！

01:30.068 --> 01:31.137
Ooh, let him in,
let him in, let him in!
哦，让他进来，
让他进来，让他进来！

01:31.310 --> 01:32.551
Bring it in, boys.
把它带进来，孩子们。

01:33.931 --> 01:36.206
That's it, set her down easy.
就这样，轻松地把她放下来。

01:36.379 --> 01:37.827
Here are the keys,
Mr. Krabs.
这是钥匙，
蟹老板。

01:37.896 --> 01:38.896
Happy vending!
快乐售卖！

01:38.965 --> 01:40.344
What is it?
它是什么？

01:40.517 --> 01:41.793
Only the greatest
moneymaker
只有最伟大的
摇钱树

01:41.965 --> 01:43.344
since the Krabby Patty.
自从蟹黄饼开始。

01:43.517 --> 01:46.448
Gentlemen, meet
"Skill Crane"!
先生们，见面吧
“技能鹤”！

01:46.620 --> 01:49.896
[ dazed]:
Ooh... Skill Crane.
[茫然]：
哦...技能鹤。

01:50.068 --> 01:51.551
At a quarter a pop,
在四分之一的流行声中，

01:51.724 --> 01:53.379
this thing will pay for itself
in no time.
这件事会收回成本
很快。

01:53.551 --> 01:55.724
Which reminds me--
step up, boys.
这让我想起——
站起来，孩子们。

01:55.896 --> 01:57.793
First one's free.
第一个是免费的。

01:57.965 --> 01:59.103
Thanks, Mr. Krabs.
谢谢，蟹老板。

01:59.275 --> 02:01.172
No, thanks, I'll pass.
不，谢谢，我会过去的。

02:01.344 --> 02:05.034
Come on, Squidward,
you know you want to.
来吧，章鱼哥，
你知道你想要。

02:05.206 --> 02:06.137
[ sighing]:
Okay.
[叹气]：
好的。

02:06.310 --> 02:07.551
If you insist.
如果你坚持的话。

02:07.724 --> 02:08.448
Thanks.
谢谢。

02:08.620 --> 02:09.551
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

02:09.724 --> 02:10.793
In the machine!
在机器里！

02:10.965 --> 02:11.758
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

02:13.965 --> 02:15.896
[ in bored monotone]:
Oh, boy, what fun.
[无聊单调]：
哦，孩子，多有趣啊。

02:18.275 --> 02:19.448
SKILL CRANE:
You lose!
技能起重机：
你输了！

02:19.620 --> 02:21.000
Did you see that, SpongeBob?!
你看到了吗，海绵宝宝？！

02:21.172 --> 02:23.241
I almost got that
on my first try!
我几乎明白了
我第一次尝试！

02:23.413 --> 02:25.758
My work here is done.
我这里的工作已经完成了。

02:25.931 --> 02:27.586
They don't call me
他们不打电话给我

02:27.758 --> 02:30.758
"Squidward Manual-
Dexterity-Tentacles"
for nothing.
《章鱼哥手册》——
敏捷-触手”
无缘无故。

02:30.931 --> 02:32.137
[ soft crackling]
[轻柔的噼啪声]

02:32.310 --> 02:34.137
Well, why don't
I give it a try?
好吧，为什么不呢
我试试？

02:34.310 --> 02:35.448
[ laughing]
[笑]

02:35.620 --> 02:36.931
Good luck. You'll never...
祝你好运。你永远不会...

02:37.103 --> 02:38.103
SKILL CRANE:
Winner!
技能起重机：
获胜者！

02:38.275 --> 02:39.551
[ siren whoops]
[警笛呼喊]

02:39.724 --> 02:41.620
It's a bear!
这是一只熊！

02:41.793 --> 02:43.655
I'm going to call you Barry.
我要叫你巴里。

02:43.827 --> 02:46.103
Hmm-- beginner's luck.
嗯——初学者的运气。

02:46.275 --> 02:48.344
Now it's the master's turn.
现在轮到主人了。

02:51.827 --> 02:52.896
[ crane whirring]
[起重机呼呼]

03:00.000 --> 03:01.379
[ buzzer sounds]
[蜂鸣器响]

03:01.551 --> 03:03.275
SKILL CRANE:
Loser!
技能起重机：
失败者！

03:03.448 --> 03:04.862
Wow, Squidward,
you flipped
him over!
哇，章鱼哥，
你翻转了
他完了！

03:04.931 --> 03:07.793
That takes an awful
amount of skill.
这需要一个可怕的
技能量。

03:07.965 --> 03:10.172
Well, thank you for saying so.
嗯，谢谢你这么说。

03:10.344 --> 03:12.034
Barry says
he's getting lonely.
巴里说
他越来越孤独了。

03:12.206 --> 03:13.379
Don't worry, Barry,
别担心，巴里，

03:13.551 --> 03:14.931
I'll get you a friend.
我会给你找个朋友。

03:15.000 --> 03:16.172
Ha! If you think
哈!如果你认为

03:16.344 --> 03:17.793
you're going to win again...
你会再次获胜...

03:17.965 --> 03:18.965
SKILL CRANE:
Winner!
技能起重机：
获胜者！

03:19.137 --> 03:20.034
[ siren whoops]
[警笛呼喊]

03:20.103 --> 03:20.896
There you go, Barry!
给你，巴里！

03:22.275 --> 03:24.172
Oh, I loosened
that one up for you.
哦，我松了
那是给你的。

03:24.344 --> 03:27.068
You would have never won
that without myskill.
你永远不会赢
那没有我的技巧。

03:27.241 --> 03:28.965
Wow, thanks for your help,
Squidward.
哇，谢谢你的帮助，
章鱼哥。

03:29.172 --> 03:30.793
Hmm.
唔。

03:30.862 --> 03:33.310
I bet I win at this thing
the very next time I try.
我打赌我在这件事上赢了
下次我尝试时。

03:33.482 --> 03:35.172
Now, all I've got to do is...
现在，我所要做的就是……

03:35.344 --> 03:37.103
At a quarter a pop,
在四分之一的流行声中，

03:37.275 --> 03:40.655
this thing pays for itself
in no time.
这件事是值得的
很快。

03:40.827 --> 03:43.827
Ha! I'm not falling
for that malarkey.
哈!我没有坠落
为了那个胡言乱语。

03:45.344 --> 03:47.448
[ quarters falling
into machine]
[季度下降
入机]

03:47.620 --> 03:49.758
[ bell dinging, siren whooping]
[铃声响起，警笛鸣响]

03:49.931 --> 03:51.551
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

03:51.724 --> 03:53.862
[ quarters falling into machine;
Squidward groans]
[ 硬币掉进机器里；
章鱼哥呻吟]

03:54.034 --> 03:55.517
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

03:55.758 --> 03:57.862
[ quarters falling into machine;
Squidward groans]
[ 硬币掉进机器里；
章鱼哥呻吟]

03:58.034 --> 03:58.965
[ bell dinging]
[铃声响起]

03:59.172 --> 03:59.620
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

04:01.103 --> 04:03.034
[ SpongeBob laughing]
[海绵宝宝大笑]

04:03.241 --> 04:05.068
SPONGEBOB:
Okay, Mrs. Wiggles--
海绵宝宝：
好吧，维格斯夫人——

04:05.137 --> 04:06.689
order up!
订购吧！

04:06.862 --> 04:09.482
Barry cooked this one
all by himself!
巴里煮了这个
全靠他自己！

04:09.655 --> 04:11.655
Oh, he makes me
so proud.
哦，他让我
很自豪。

04:11.827 --> 04:13.965
[ eerie, creaky voice]:
Squid-ward?
[怪异、嘎吱作响的声音]：
鱿鱼区？

04:14.137 --> 04:16.655
[ hook squeaking softly]
[钩子轻轻吱吱作响]

04:18.344 --> 04:20.000
[ eerie, creaky voice]:
Squid-ward?
[怪异、嘎吱作响的声音]：
鱿鱼区？

04:21.482 --> 04:23.517
Oh, what the...?
哦，那是什么……？

04:23.689 --> 04:25.586
All right,
let's get this over with.
好吧，
让我们结束这件事吧。

04:25.758 --> 04:26.000
Need change?
需要改变吗？

04:28.862 --> 04:29.827
There you are.
你就在那里。

04:30.000 --> 04:31.103
Gee, thanks.
哎呀，谢谢。

04:31.275 --> 04:32.793
No, no, Mr. Squidward.
不，不，章鱼哥先生。

04:33.000 --> 04:33.896
Thank you.
谢谢。

04:35.103 --> 04:37.137
[ crane whirring]
[起重机呼呼]

04:37.206 --> 04:38.275
SKILL CRANE:
You lose!
技能起重机：
你输了！

04:38.448 --> 04:39.586
Need some more change?
需要更多改变吗？

04:41.620 --> 04:43.068
[ buzzer droning]
[蜂鸣器嗡嗡声]

04:43.137 --> 04:43.689
[ beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

04:47.068 --> 04:48.517
[ buzzer droning]
[蜂鸣器嗡嗡声]

04:48.689 --> 04:50.413
[ mechanical voice laughing]
[机械笑声]

04:50.586 --> 04:53.448
[ change jingling]
【变叮当】

04:56.103 --> 04:57.206
[ buzzer droning]
[蜂鸣器嗡嗡声]

04:57.379 --> 04:58.344
SKILL CRANE:
You lose!
技能起重机：
你输了！

04:58.517 --> 04:59.724
Need some change?
需要一些改变吗？

04:59.931 --> 05:00.862
No.
不。

05:01.034 --> 05:02.448
W-Why?
W-为什么？

05:02.517 --> 05:06.103
[ softly]:
Because I'm all out of...
[轻声]：
因为我已经没力气了...

05:06.172 --> 05:08.655
money!
钱！

05:08.827 --> 05:09.965
All out of...
全部出于...

05:10.172 --> 05:11.172
Hmm.
唔。

05:11.344 --> 05:13.793
Boys, it's payday!
孩子们，发薪日到了！

05:13.965 --> 05:15.137
[ gasps]
[喘气]

05:15.310 --> 05:16.965
But Mr. Krabs,
today is Monday.
但是蟹老板先生，
今天是星期一。

05:17.137 --> 05:19.586
Uh... no, it's payday,
me boy.
呃...不，今天是发薪日，
我男孩。

05:19.758 --> 05:21.344
Here's your check,
SpongeBob.
这是你的支票，
海绵宝宝。

05:21.517 --> 05:23.103
♪ Money, money, money,
money, money! ♪
♪ 钱，钱，钱，
钱，钱！ ♪

05:23.172 --> 05:24.655
I took the liberty
我冒昧地

05:24.827 --> 05:26.862
of turning your paycheck
into quarters
改变你的薪水
分成四等分

05:27.034 --> 05:30.034
just in case you want to,
oh, I don't know,
以防万一你愿意
哦，我不知道，

05:30.206 --> 05:31.965
do laundry or buy a soda
洗衣服或买苏打水

05:32.034 --> 05:34.034
or... something.[ change jingling]
或者...什么东西。[改变叮当声]

05:34.206 --> 05:36.103
Very funny, Mr. Krabs!
非常有趣，蟹老板！

05:36.172 --> 05:37.862
If I can't win
如果我赢不了

05:38.034 --> 05:40.206
one of those stupid things
with thisquarter,
那些愚蠢的事情之一
与本季度相比，

05:40.379 --> 05:41.068
I'm walking away.
我要走开。

05:45.172 --> 05:47.896
Pardon me, Squidward,
SpongeBear Junior here
请原谅我，章鱼哥，
小海绵熊在这里

05:48.068 --> 05:50.000
wants me to win him
a little brother.
希望我赢得他
一个小兄弟。

05:57.172 --> 05:58.586
SKILL CRANE:
You are a winner!
技能起重机：
你是赢家！

05:58.793 --> 05:59.827
Huh?
啊？

06:00.000 --> 06:01.275
Two in one quarter?
一季度两个？

06:01.344 --> 06:02.758
That's not fair.
这不公平。

06:07.137 --> 06:08.275
What's that, Clown Frown?
那是什么，小丑皱眉？

06:08.344 --> 06:09.931
[ horn tootling]
[ 喇叭声 ]

06:10.103 --> 06:11.620
Oh, you'd rather sit
next to Lovely Lion?
哦，你宁愿坐
可爱的狮子旁边？

06:11.793 --> 06:14.862
[ crane whirring]
[起重机呼呼]

06:17.689 --> 06:19.551
There you are, nice and cozy.
你就在那里，美好又舒适。

06:19.724 --> 06:21.137
See you later, Squidward.
稍后见，章鱼哥。

06:32.620 --> 06:34.000
[ Squidward sighs]
[章鱼哥叹气]

06:34.172 --> 06:36.068
A little mind-numbing television
有点让人麻木的电视

06:36.137 --> 06:40.068
ought to help me forget
about that stupid machine.
应该帮助我忘记
关于那台愚蠢的机器。

06:40.137 --> 06:43.827
[ mechanical laughter,
buzzer from crane droning]
[机械笑声，
起重机嗡嗡声的蜂鸣器]

06:47.310 --> 06:50.655
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

06:54.137 --> 06:56.482
You've had a rough day, Squiddy,
你这一天过得很艰难，鱿鱼，

06:56.655 --> 07:00.068
but that doesn't mean tomorrow
won't be better.
但这并不意味着明天
不会更好。

07:00.137 --> 07:02.965
[ mechanical laughter,
buzzer from crane droning]
[机械笑声，
起重机嗡嗡声的蜂鸣器]

07:03.137 --> 07:05.586
Oh... phooey!
哦...呸！

07:05.758 --> 07:07.448
[ whimpers]
[呜咽]

07:07.620 --> 07:08.862
[ teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

07:10.448 --> 07:11.206
Oh!
哦！

07:13.206 --> 07:15.206
[ crane whirring]
[起重机呼呼]

07:15.379 --> 07:16.344
[ buzzer drones]
[蜂鸣器无人机]

07:16.413 --> 07:19.586
I got to win that crane!
我一定要赢得那只起重机！

07:29.655 --> 07:30.724
[ yelps]
[尖叫声]

07:30.896 --> 07:32.586
Just once!
就一次！

07:32.758 --> 07:36.379
Please, oh, please,
let me win one time.
拜托，噢，拜托，
让我赢一次。

07:36.551 --> 07:38.344
Squid, I think
you have a problem.
我觉得是鱿鱼
你有问题。

07:38.413 --> 07:39.862
No, he doesn't!
不，他不！

07:40.034 --> 07:42.241
You don't listen to him,
Squidward,
你不听他的话
章鱼哥，

07:42.413 --> 07:44.068
you keep playing
until you win!
你继续玩
直到你赢！

07:44.241 --> 07:45.206
What's this?
这是什么？

07:45.275 --> 07:47.241
The deed to my house.
我家的地契。

07:47.413 --> 07:48.241
Okey-dokey, then.
那么好吧。

07:48.413 --> 07:49.206
Carry on.
继续。

07:50.482 --> 07:52.896
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

07:53.068 --> 07:57.965
If I could just win once,
I'd never play again!
如果我能赢一次就好了
我再也不会玩了！

07:58.137 --> 08:00.793
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

08:00.965 --> 08:03.172
Hey-- you want me
to tell you the secret
嘿——你想要我
告诉你这个秘密

08:03.344 --> 08:04.620
of how to win
on this machine?
论如何获胜
在这台机器上？

08:04.793 --> 08:06.758
SpongeBob--
there's a secret?
海绵宝宝——
有秘密吗？

08:06.931 --> 08:08.034
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

08:08.206 --> 08:12.275
Tell me... the... secret.
告诉我……秘密。

08:12.344 --> 08:14.344
Are you ready to be a winner?
您准备好成为赢家了吗？

08:14.413 --> 08:15.413
Yes!
Yeah?
是的！
是的？

08:15.586 --> 08:16.586
Yes?
Yeah!
是的？
是的！

08:16.793 --> 08:18.034
Yeah!
Yes?
是的！
是的？

08:18.206 --> 08:19.275
SpongeBob, the secret!
海绵宝宝，秘密！

08:19.448 --> 08:20.862
Okay, Squidward, okay!
好吧，章鱼哥，好吧！

08:21.034 --> 08:24.482
I face the crane,
deposit my quarter...
我面对着起重机，
存入我的四分之一...

08:24.655 --> 08:27.344
then I close my eyes.
然后我闭上眼睛。

08:27.517 --> 08:29.068
Close your eyes?
闭上眼睛吗？

08:29.241 --> 08:31.931
Quiet, Squidward--
I'm being the crane.
安静，章鱼哥——
我就是那只起重机

08:32.103 --> 08:33.275
Oh, that's ludi...
噢，那是路迪……

08:33.448 --> 08:34.344
SKILL CRANE:
Winner!
技能起重机：
获胜者！

08:34.413 --> 08:35.379
See? Now you try.
看？现在你试试。

08:35.551 --> 08:37.206
This is ridiculous.
这太荒谬了。

08:37.379 --> 08:39.310
If I close my eyes,
how will I know
where...
如果我闭上眼睛
我怎么知道
哪里...

08:39.379 --> 08:40.965
Do you want to win or not?
你想赢还是不想赢？

08:41.137 --> 08:43.758
Yes! Yes, I do!
是的！是的，我愿意！

08:43.931 --> 08:45.275
Okay.
好的。

08:45.448 --> 08:46.551
Squidward,
put your quarter in.
章鱼哥，
把你的25美分硬币放进去。

08:46.724 --> 08:48.172
But this is
my last quarter.
但这是
我的最后一个季度。

08:48.344 --> 08:49.413
In the machine, Squidward.
在机器里，章鱼哥。

08:49.586 --> 08:50.517
Okay, okay!
好吧好吧！

08:50.689 --> 08:51.517
Close your eyes.
闭上你的眼睛。

08:52.620 --> 08:54.551
Now be the crane.
现在成为起重机。

08:54.724 --> 08:57.310
Be the crane.
成为起重机。

08:57.379 --> 08:59.448
SPONGEBOB:
Be the crane.
海绵宝宝：
成为起重机。

08:59.620 --> 09:01.448
Be the crane.
成为起重机。

09:01.620 --> 09:02.586
SKILL CRANE:
Winner!
技能起重机：
获胜者！

09:02.758 --> 09:03.724
[ bell dings]
[铃声]

09:03.896 --> 09:05.172
[ whooping]
[呼喊]

09:05.344 --> 09:06.379
Yeah!
是的！

09:06.448 --> 09:07.413
I knew I could do it!
我知道我能做到！

09:07.586 --> 09:08.482
[ laughing]
[笑]

09:08.655 --> 09:10.000
I'm a winner!
我是赢家！

09:10.172 --> 09:11.310
You're a winner!
你是赢家！

09:11.482 --> 09:13.275
I am a winner, aren't I?
我是胜利者，不是吗？

09:13.448 --> 09:15.275
Winner, winner, winner!
赢家，赢家，赢家！

09:15.448 --> 09:17.620
Winner...!
优胜者...！

09:17.793 --> 09:19.586
I'm a winner, everybody!
大家好，我是胜利者！

09:19.758 --> 09:21.172
You hear that?!
你听到了吗？

09:21.344 --> 09:22.379
[ cricket chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

09:22.448 --> 09:23.379
[ door crashes open]
[门突然打开了]

09:23.551 --> 09:26.172
I'm... a winner.
我是……胜利者。

09:26.241 --> 09:28.965
Funny, last time I checked,
you were a cashier.
有趣的是，我上次检查时，
你是一名收银员。

09:29.137 --> 09:34.551
Yuck it up all you want,
Mr. Krabs, but just remember:
随心所欲地吐出来吧
螃蟹先生，但请记住：

09:34.724 --> 09:38.862
You're yucking
in the presence of a winner!
你在呕吐
在胜利者面前！

09:39.068 --> 09:39.689
Ha!
哈!

09:41.379 --> 09:43.310
I'll try to remember that.
我会尽力记住这一点。

09:43.482 --> 09:49.241
3,498 of Squidward's quarters,
3,499 of Squidward's quarters...
章鱼哥的3,498个宿舍，
章鱼哥的 3,499 个宿舍……

09:49.413 --> 09:51.275
Triple-decker on deck.
甲板上有三层甲板。

09:51.448 --> 09:52.827
Make way for the winner!
为胜利者让路！

09:55.551 --> 09:57.344
SKILL CRANE:
You lose!
技能起重机：
你输了！

09:57.413 --> 09:59.103
[ sighs]
[叹气]

09:59.275 --> 10:00.724
[ softly]:
You didn't win
the prize?
[轻声]：
你没有赢
奖品？

10:00.931 --> 10:02.206
No.
不。

10:02.379 --> 10:03.517
You know what
that means?
你知道吗
这意味着？

10:03.689 --> 10:04.931
No. What?
不，什么？

10:05.103 --> 10:06.586
It means...
这意味着...

10:06.758 --> 10:09.310
you have no skills
and you're a loser!
你没有技能
你是个失败者！

10:09.379 --> 10:10.413
Ha!
哈!

10:10.586 --> 10:12.379
[ cackling]
[咯咯笑]

10:12.551 --> 10:13.827
I'm a winner,
see my prize.
我是胜利者，
看看我的奖品。

10:14.000 --> 10:15.379
You're a loser
who sits and cries.
你是个失败者
谁坐着哭泣。

10:15.448 --> 10:18.206
[ cackling]
[咯咯笑]

10:18.275 --> 10:19.896
Ow, ow, ow, ow,
ow, ow, ow, ow!
噢，噢，噢，噢，
噢，噢，噢，噢！

10:21.965 --> 10:23.551
Did you see how
I handled that crane?
你看到了吗
我操控了那台起重机？

10:23.724 --> 10:25.275
I sure did.
我确实做到了。

10:25.448 --> 10:26.551
I think I have
the magic touch.
我想我有
神奇的触感。

10:26.724 --> 10:27.793
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

10:27.965 --> 10:29.275
I just closed my eyes
我刚刚闭上眼睛

10:29.448 --> 10:31.034
and became the crane.
并变成了起重机。

10:31.206 --> 10:33.206
[ bored]:
Oh, yeah,
you're the man.
[无聊]：
哦，是的，
你就是那个男人。

10:33.379 --> 10:36.034
SpongeBob, look.
海绵宝宝，看。

10:36.206 --> 10:39.000
Uh, Squidward, I don't think
the same principles apply.
呃，章鱼哥，我不认为
同样的原则也适用。

10:39.172 --> 10:41.034
Be the crane.
成为起重机。

10:41.206 --> 10:41.793
Wait, Squidward!
等等，章鱼哥！

10:43.724 --> 10:45.344
Be the crane.
成为起重机。

10:48.655 --> 10:50.344
He did it!
他做到了！

10:50.517 --> 10:52.620
Yay, Squidward!
耶，章鱼哥！

10:52.793 --> 10:55.517
Be the crane, be the crane.
成为起重机，成为起重机。

10:55.689 --> 10:56.758
Be the crane...
成为起重机...

10:56.931 --> 10:58.379
You know this guy?
你认识这个人吗？

10:58.448 --> 11:00.206
Yeah,
that's Squidward.
是的，
那是章鱼哥。

11:00.379 --> 11:02.206
He's got
the magic touch.
他有
神奇的触感。

11:02.379 --> 11:03.000
Ding!
叮！

11:06.586 --> 11:07.551
Ta-dah!
哒哒！

11:07.724 --> 11:08.931
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

11:09.103 --> 11:10.206
Squidward,
open your eyes!
章鱼哥，
睁开你的眼睛！

11:11.758 --> 11:15.793
Oh, uh... be the crane,
be the crane.
哦，呃...成为起重机，
是起重机。

11:19.689 --> 11:21.689
Look out, SpongeBob,
I can't stop!
小心，海绵宝宝，
我停不下来！

11:24.793 --> 11:25.827
Be the crane,
be the crane!
成为起重机，
成为起重机！

11:27.344 --> 11:29.482
Okay, don't be the crane,
don't be the crane!
好吧，别当起重机，
不要成为起重机！

11:29.655 --> 11:33.413
[ Squidward screaming]
[章鱼哥尖叫]

11:33.482 --> 11:35.413
[ all screaming]
[全都尖叫]

11:40.344 --> 11:42.413
[ crashing]
[崩溃]

11:44.758 --> 11:45.758
What the...?!
什么……？！

11:45.931 --> 11:48.413
Oh, my, oh, my.
哦，天哪，哦，天哪。

11:48.586 --> 11:50.172
Time to go, Teddy.
是时候出发了，泰迪。

11:50.344 --> 11:53.344
Just where do you think
you're going, crane master?
只是你觉得哪里
鹤大师，你要去吗？

11:53.517 --> 11:55.000
You ain't going anywhere.
你哪儿也不去。

11:55.172 --> 11:56.862
[ whistling; crane chugging]
[ 吹口哨；起重机嘎嘎作响]

11:57.034 --> 11:58.413
SPONGEBOB:
Hang on, buddy!
海绵宝宝：
坚持住，伙计！

11:58.620 --> 11:59.344
I got you!
我接到你了！

12:02.103 --> 12:04.896
I guess I can only pick up toys.
我想我只能捡起玩具。

12:05.068 --> 12:06.068
[ workers growling]
[工人咆哮]

12:06.241 --> 12:07.172
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

12:20.793 --> 12:24.379
[ snoring and wheezing]
[打鼾和喘息]

12:24.448 --> 12:28.448
[ snoring and humming]
[打鼾和嗡嗡声]

12:28.517 --> 12:33.448
[ snoring and muttering]
[打鼾和咕哝]

12:33.517 --> 12:37.551
[ foghorn blowing]
[雾号吹响]

12:37.724 --> 12:39.862
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

12:40.034 --> 12:41.586
Good morning,
Squidward!
早上好，
章鱼哥！

12:41.758 --> 12:44.172
SpongeBob, what are
you doing in my house?
海绵宝宝，什么是
你在我家做什么？

12:44.379 --> 12:47.137
I came to make sure
you don't oversleep
and miss work.
我来是为了确认一下
你没有睡过头
并错过工作。

12:47.310 --> 12:48.586
Oh, gee, SpongeBob,
哦，天啊，海绵宝宝，

12:48.758 --> 12:50.413
that's very thoughtful
of you.
这很周到
你的。

12:50.482 --> 12:52.000
My pleasure, Squidward.
我很荣幸，章鱼哥。

12:52.172 --> 12:54.172
That's what good
neighbors are for.
就是这样好
邻居是为了。

12:54.241 --> 12:58.586
You did overlook one
teensy, little detail, however.
你确实忽略了一个
然而，很小，细节很少。

12:58.758 --> 13:00.241
What's that, Squidward?
那是什么，章鱼哥？

13:00.413 --> 13:01.827
It's Sunday!
今天是星期日！

13:02.172 --> 13:06.344
A good neighbor doesn't
bother me on Sunday!
好邻居不会
周日烦我！

13:06.517 --> 13:07.551
Sunday!
星期日！

13:07.724 --> 13:09.448
No wonder Squidward's grumpy.
难怪章鱼哥脾气暴躁。

13:09.620 --> 13:11.206
He forgot his Sunday papers.
他忘记了周日报纸。

13:11.413 --> 13:13.758
This will show Squidward
I'm a good neighbor.
这将显示章鱼哥
我是个好邻居。

13:13.931 --> 13:15.137
I'll bring it to him.
我会把它带给他。

13:18.413 --> 13:19.448
[ grunting]
[咕噜声]

13:19.517 --> 13:20.689
Man, this is heavy!
伙计，这很重！

13:24.517 --> 13:25.862
Oh! Pardon me.
哦！对不起。

13:26.034 --> 13:27.344
Hey, watch where
you're going!
嘿，看哪里
你走吧！

13:27.517 --> 13:28.413
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

13:28.482 --> 13:30.000
A newspaper monster!
报纸怪物！

13:30.172 --> 13:31.517
[ screams]:
Aah, monster!
[尖叫声]：
啊啊，怪物！

13:31.586 --> 13:33.137
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

13:33.310 --> 13:36.344
Will you two nincompoops
kindly quiet down?!
你们两个笨蛋愿意吗
请安静一点？！

13:36.517 --> 13:40.379
I am not going to let them ruin
the rest of my Sunday.
我不会让他们毁掉
我周日剩下的时间。

13:40.551 --> 13:43.137
[ humming]
[嗡嗡声]

13:43.310 --> 13:45.931
My Sunday relaxation kit.
我的周日放松套装。

13:46.103 --> 13:51.482
Let's see, pillow, placed just
so for slight foot elevation...
让我们看看，枕头，刚刚放好
所以对于轻微的脚抬高...

13:51.551 --> 13:54.586
flower to brighten the room...
鲜花可以照亮房间...

13:54.758 --> 13:55.862
flower fragrance...
花香...

13:57.517 --> 13:59.413
[ sighs]
[叹气]

13:59.586 --> 14:00.931
And the final touch...
还有最后的接触...

14:01.103 --> 14:02.724
[ touch tones beeping]
[ 按键音蜂鸣声 ]

14:02.896 --> 14:05.310
Yes, I'd like to order
the Sunday special.
是的，我想订购
周日特别节目。

14:05.379 --> 14:08.413
Yes, the pedicure-
and-foot-massage house call,
是的，修脚——
足部按摩上门服务，

14:08.482 --> 14:09.689
that is correct.
这是正确的。

14:09.862 --> 14:11.448
See you at 4:00, my good man.
4:00 见，我的好人。

14:13.034 --> 14:16.517
This is going to be
a heavenly day.
这将是
天堂般的一天。

14:16.586 --> 14:18.034
Oh, I almost forgot.
哦，我差点忘了。

14:18.206 --> 14:19.310
Bon-bon.
邦邦。

14:19.482 --> 14:22.793
Hello there,
heaven's little wonder.
你好，
天上的小奇迹。

14:22.965 --> 14:27.310
Take me on a chocolate vacation.
带我去享受巧克力假期。

14:27.482 --> 14:30.827
[ Patrick and SpongeBob
whoop like sirens]
[帕特里克和海绵宝宝
像警报一样呼喊]

14:31.000 --> 14:32.172
Om...
Om...
嗡...
嗡...

14:32.344 --> 14:33.517
Om...
嗡...

14:33.689 --> 14:35.448
Om...
嗡...

14:35.620 --> 14:37.931
BOTH:
By the all-seeing eye,
两者：
以全视之眼来看，

14:38.103 --> 14:41.586
ye are worthy,
we are not.
你们是值得的，
我们不是。

14:41.758 --> 14:43.551
What are you
two idiots doing?
你是什么
两个白痴在做什么？

14:43.724 --> 14:45.172
Secret ritual.
秘密仪式。

14:45.344 --> 14:46.586
To inaugurate you
as president.
为您揭幕
作为总统。

14:46.758 --> 14:49.206
Me? President of Bikini Bottom?
我？比基尼泳裤总裁？

14:49.379 --> 14:52.310
I knew the people would come
to their senses.
我知道人们会来
到他们的感觉。

14:52.482 --> 14:53.724
No, silly--
不，傻瓜——

14:53.896 --> 14:56.310
not the president
of Bikini Bottom.
不是总统
的比基尼底部。

14:56.482 --> 14:58.103
Even better.
甚至更好。

14:58.275 --> 14:59.310
Better?
更好的？

14:59.482 --> 15:01.068
You're the president
你是总统

15:01.241 --> 15:04.413
of the Secret Royal Order
of the Good Neighbor Lodge.
秘密皇家勋章
好邻居旅馆的。

15:04.586 --> 15:05.931
The what?
什么？

15:06.103 --> 15:08.206
Is this some
stupid club
you two made up?
这是一些
愚蠢的俱乐部
你们两个和好了吗？

15:08.413 --> 15:09.448
Oh!
Oh!
哦！
哦！

15:09.620 --> 15:11.344
[ both giggle]
[两人都咯咯笑]

15:11.517 --> 15:12.517
Maybe.
或许。

15:12.586 --> 15:14.689
[ both giggle]
[两人都咯咯笑]

15:14.862 --> 15:16.241
It's a secret.
这是一个秘密。

15:16.413 --> 15:17.551
[ both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

15:17.620 --> 15:19.103
Fine!
美好的！

15:19.275 --> 15:22.482
As my first presidential
decree, uh...
作为我的第一任总统
法令，呃……

15:22.551 --> 15:24.275
why don't you, uh,
你为什么不，呃，

15:24.448 --> 15:26.586
go out and paint
all the leaves
on the trees
出去画画
所有的叶子
在树上

15:26.758 --> 15:28.862
to make the neighborhood
look nicer.
使邻里
看起来更好一些。

15:29.034 --> 15:31.310
Now, out, out,
out, out, out.
现在，出去，出去，
出去，出去，出去。

15:31.482 --> 15:34.206
That'll keep 'em busy
for a few Sundays.
这会让他们很忙
几个星期天。

15:34.379 --> 15:37.310
What color should we
paint the leaves?
我们应该选择什么颜色
画叶子？

15:37.482 --> 15:39.034
Aah! Polka dots.
啊啊！波尔卡圆点。

15:39.206 --> 15:40.551
Now, don't
bother me anymore.
现在，不要
不再打扰我了。

15:40.724 --> 15:44.000
BOTH:
Wow, polka dots!
两者：
哇，圆点！

15:44.172 --> 15:46.620
Our new president
is a genius.
我们的新任总统
是个天才。

15:46.793 --> 15:47.793
Yeah.
是的。

15:47.965 --> 15:50.000
[ both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

15:50.172 --> 15:51.517
BOTH:
See you later, Squidward.
两者：
稍后见，章鱼哥。

15:52.862 --> 15:55.344
Whenever you're
ready, Patrick.
每当你在
准备好了，帕特里克。

15:59.551 --> 16:00.931
Hold still, buddy.
别动，伙计。

16:07.137 --> 16:09.689
Okay, Pat, give me
a quick shake.
好的，帕特，给我
快速摇晃。

16:09.862 --> 16:11.241
Okey-dokey.
好吧，好吧。

16:14.482 --> 16:17.275
Okay, I'm ready!
好的，我准备好了！

16:24.137 --> 16:26.482
Hey, that worked
perfectly.
嘿，这有效
完美。

16:26.655 --> 16:28.517
Come on,
good neighbor Patrick.
来吧，
好邻居帕特里克。

16:28.689 --> 16:30.586
Let's paint
the town polka-dot.
我们来画画吧
小镇圆点。

16:30.655 --> 16:32.413
[ clock chiming]
[时钟鸣响]

16:32.586 --> 16:33.862
Oh, no, it's already noon.
哦，不对，已经是中午了。

16:34.034 --> 16:35.896
I will be darned
if I let those morons
我会被诅咒的
如果我让那些白痴

16:36.068 --> 16:38.172
eat up any more
of my valuable Sunday.
再吃下去
我宝贵的周日。

16:38.344 --> 16:41.000
SPONGEBOB AND PATRICK:
♪ Good neighbors are we. ♪
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：
♪ 我们是好邻居。 ♪

16:41.172 --> 16:42.586
♪ La-la-la-la-la. ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦。 ♪

16:42.793 --> 16:43.931
What's going on
out there?
发生了什么事
在那里？

16:44.103 --> 16:45.586
Hi, President Squidward.
你好，章鱼哥总统。

16:45.758 --> 16:47.000
Almost done painting...
快画完了...

16:47.172 --> 16:48.379
[ screams]
My eyes!
[尖叫声]
我的眼睛！

16:48.551 --> 16:53.241
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

16:53.413 --> 16:54.551
Look out!
当心！

16:54.724 --> 16:55.689
[ shrieks]
[尖叫声]

16:55.758 --> 16:57.655
[ brakes screech]
[刹车声]

16:57.827 --> 16:59.448
Oh, your poor man.
哦，你可怜的人。

16:59.620 --> 17:00.862
You must be very sick.
你一定病得很重。

17:01.034 --> 17:02.517
Let us take you
to the hospital.
让我们带你
去医院。

17:02.689 --> 17:04.586
No, really,
I'm fine,
please.
不，真的，
我很好，
请。

17:04.758 --> 17:05.689
No. I'm fine.
不，我很好。

17:05.758 --> 17:07.137
[ tires screech]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

17:07.310 --> 17:08.793
BOTH:
See you later, neighbor.
两者：
再见，邻居。

17:08.965 --> 17:10.310
It isa lovely day
这是美好的一天

17:10.482 --> 17:12.034
for a ride
in the country.
搭便车
在国内。

17:12.206 --> 17:15.172
Yeah. Our president
sure knows how to live.
是的。我们的总裁
肯定知道如何生活。

17:16.620 --> 17:18.137
I would like
to call this meeting
我想要
召开这次会议

17:18.310 --> 17:20.586
of the Good Neighbor Lodge
to order.
好邻居旅馆的
订购。

17:20.758 --> 17:22.620
Let's begin with roll call.
让我们从点名开始。

17:22.793 --> 17:24.655
Patrick.
帕特里克.

17:24.827 --> 17:27.103
[ snoring]
[打鼾]

17:27.275 --> 17:28.827
Okay.
好的。

17:29.000 --> 17:29.655
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

17:32.793 --> 17:34.448
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

17:34.620 --> 17:36.517
Squidward, you home?
章鱼哥，你在家吗？

17:36.689 --> 17:38.344
Did you find him,
SpongeBob?
你找到他了吗，
海绵宝宝？

17:38.517 --> 17:41.655
Nope. I guess
he's still on
his Sunday drive.
没有。我猜
他还在
他周日开车。

17:41.862 --> 17:43.827
Or maybe he's on
a secret mission.
或者也许他正在
一项秘密任务。

17:44.000 --> 17:46.137
I hope he's not
in danger.
我希望他不是
处于危险之中。

17:46.310 --> 17:47.482
Danger?!
危险？！

17:47.551 --> 17:49.482
As members of the
Good Neighbor Lodge,
作为成员
好邻居旅馆，

17:49.551 --> 17:52.689
we are sworn to protect
our presidentefrom danger.
我们发誓要保护
我们的总统免遭危险。

17:52.758 --> 17:54.413
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

17:54.482 --> 17:56.965
Somebody ordered a relaxing
pedicure and foot massage:
有人点了一份放松的
修脚和足部按摩：

17:57.137 --> 17:58.448
the Sunday special.
周日特别节目。

17:58.517 --> 18:00.172
We better check
this guy out,
我们最好检查一下
这家伙出来了

18:00.344 --> 18:02.310
make sure he's safe
for Squidward.
确保他安全
为了章鱼哥。

18:02.482 --> 18:06.000
At least I still have my Sunday
pedicure to look forward to.
至少我还有周日
足疗值得期待。

18:06.172 --> 18:08.689
[ SpongeBob and Patrick
giggling]
[海绵宝宝和帕特里克
咯咯笑]

18:08.862 --> 18:11.724
What are you two
doing in my house?
你们两个是什么
在我家做什么？

18:11.896 --> 18:13.517
We're checking
to make sure
我们正在检查
以确保

18:13.689 --> 18:15.793
this guy really
is a certified
foot masseur
这家伙真的
是经过认证的
足部按摩师

18:15.965 --> 18:17.586
and not some kind
of assassin.
而不是某种
的刺客。

18:17.655 --> 18:19.758
Well, I say
he checks out a-okay.
好吧，我说
他检查了一下，好吧。

18:19.931 --> 18:23.482
Squidward, have
you ever seen more
lovely French tips?
章鱼哥，有
你见过更多
可爱的法语小贴士？

18:23.689 --> 18:25.448
French tips,
huh?
法语小贴士，
嗯？

18:25.620 --> 18:30.344
All right, pal, make with a
relaxing foot massage, pronto!
好吧，朋友，用一个
放松足部按摩，很快！

18:30.517 --> 18:33.413
Uh-oh. Uh, sorry,
your hour's up.
呃哦。呃，抱歉，
你的时间到了。

18:39.862 --> 18:42.000
All right, you two, out!
好了，你们两个，出去吧！

18:43.862 --> 18:47.241
Don't even think about dragging
your empty skulls around here
根本就别想拖
你的头骨空空如也

18:47.413 --> 18:48.827
for the rest of the day
当天剩下的时间

18:48.896 --> 18:50.034
or tomorrow
or next week!
或明天
或者下周！

18:50.206 --> 18:51.482
Does that include...
这其中是否包括...

18:51.655 --> 18:53.103
Yes, it does!
是的，确实如此！

18:53.275 --> 18:54.655
Gee, Patrick,
do you think
哎呀，帕特里克，
你认为

18:54.724 --> 18:57.413
Squidward was trying
to tell us something?
章鱼哥正在尝试
告诉我们一些事情？

18:57.586 --> 18:59.655
Yes, I was!
是的，我是！

18:59.827 --> 19:03.344
Youcall yourselves
good neighbors?
你们自称
好邻居？

19:03.517 --> 19:06.586
You're the worst
neighbors ever!
你是最糟糕的
永远的邻居！

19:06.758 --> 19:10.034
You don't deserve
to wear those fezzes!
你不值得
戴那些毡帽！

19:12.551 --> 19:15.965
Gee, Pat, maybe
President Squidward's right.
哎呀，帕特，也许吧
章鱼哥总统是对的。

19:16.137 --> 19:17.620
Yeah.
是的。

19:17.793 --> 19:19.827
I guess we aren't good
neighbors after all.
我想我们都不好
毕竟是邻居。

19:20.000 --> 19:21.896
No, you aren't!
不，你不是！

19:22.068 --> 19:23.862
You're horrible neighbors!
你们真是可怕的邻居！

19:23.931 --> 19:25.827
[ hyperventilates]
[换气过度]

19:26.000 --> 19:28.827
And stop calling me
president!
别再打电话给我了
总统！

19:28.896 --> 19:30.379
Come on, let's go.
来吧，我们走吧。

19:32.655 --> 19:35.241
There are only three hours
of my Sunday left.
只有三个小时
我的周日离开了。

19:35.413 --> 19:37.620
They took it all away.
他们把一切都拿走了。

19:37.793 --> 19:40.172
I didn't even get to read
the Sunday paper.
我什至都没来得及读书
星期日报纸。

19:49.103 --> 19:51.758
[ snarling]
[咆哮]

19:51.827 --> 19:54.413
Good neighbors, my right...
好邻居，我的权利...

19:54.586 --> 19:55.655
Hello.
你好。

19:55.827 --> 19:56.793
[ reading aloud]:
[朗读]：

20:02.103 --> 20:05.896
[ snickering maliciously]
[恶意窃笑]

20:06.068 --> 20:11.551
[ laughing maniacally]
[疯狂大笑]

20:14.448 --> 20:16.413
COMPUTER:
System activated.
电脑：
系统激活。

20:16.586 --> 20:18.310
Well, that
ought to do it.
嗯，那个
应该这样做。

20:18.482 --> 20:20.724
Let's see those imbeciles
try to get in here now.
让我们看看那些无知的人
现在尝试进入这里。

20:20.793 --> 20:22.793
President Squidward?[ yelps]
章鱼哥总统？[尖叫]

20:22.862 --> 20:24.413
What the...!
什么啊……！

20:24.482 --> 20:26.758
We hereby present you
with this delicious cake.
我们在此向您介绍
有了这个美味的蛋糕。

20:26.931 --> 20:29.896
SQUIDWARD [ reading]:
章鱼哥[阅读]：

20:29.965 --> 20:31.413
Security system,
help!
安全系统，
帮忙！

20:31.586 --> 20:34.103
Intruder alert,
intruder alert.
入侵者警报，
入侵者警报。

20:34.275 --> 20:35.310
What's the matter
with you?
怎么了
和你在一起吗？

20:37.000 --> 20:38.896
Oh, you infernal
contraption.
噢，你这个地狱般的人
装置。

20:39.068 --> 20:41.482
I'll ship you off
to the scrap heap!
我会把你送走
到废品堆去！

20:45.275 --> 20:47.172
[ shrieks]
[尖叫声]

20:52.000 --> 20:52.931
[ zapping]
[ 电击 ]

20:53.103 --> 20:54.379
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

20:58.862 --> 21:00.034
[ laughs]
[笑]

21:00.206 --> 21:01.724
It's like
a carnival ride.
就像
嘉年华之旅。

21:01.896 --> 21:03.379
Run for your lives!
为你的生命而奔跑！

21:05.137 --> 21:06.379
[ Squidward shouts]
[章鱼哥大喊]

21:06.551 --> 21:08.068
What the...
什么...

21:08.241 --> 21:09.862
What are you doing?!
你在干什么？！

21:17.931 --> 21:19.482
Huh?
啊？

21:19.655 --> 21:22.862
I only have half an hour
of me-time left
我只有半个小时
剩下的我的时间

21:23.068 --> 21:25.655
and the idiots took my house.
这些白痴占领了我的房子。

21:25.827 --> 21:30.482
Which means those boobs
aren't around to bug me.
这意味着那些胸部
不会来打扰我。

21:30.655 --> 21:33.310
Ooh, just what
I've been waiting for.
哦，只是什么
我一直在等待。

21:33.482 --> 21:38.482
[ laughing hysterically]
[歇斯底里地大笑]

21:38.655 --> 21:42.758
Iam going to relax,
if it kills me.
我要放松一下，
如果它杀了我。

21:42.965 --> 21:44.862
Ah!
啊!

21:45.068 --> 21:48.862
[ crowd screaming]
[人群尖叫]

21:49.034 --> 21:49.827
Fire!
火！

21:57.724 --> 22:01.000
Whoa, Squidward's house is
destroying the neighborhood.
哇哦，章鱼哥的家是
破坏邻居。

22:01.172 --> 22:02.793
We got to turn
this thing off.
我们必须转身
这件事关了。

22:02.965 --> 22:04.206
Nope, not it.
不，不是它。

22:04.379 --> 22:05.862
[ toilet flushes]
Nope.
[马桶冲水]
不。

22:06.034 --> 22:06.862
Nope.
没有。

22:08.103 --> 22:09.551
That's not it, either.
也不是这样。

22:11.931 --> 22:16.931
This Sunday relaxation
really hits the spot.
这周日放松一下
真的很到位。

22:19.482 --> 22:22.448
Hmm, where to look?
嗯，去哪里看？

22:22.620 --> 22:25.827
Hmm, this "off" button
seems suspicious.
嗯，这个“关闭”按钮
似乎很可疑。

22:27.689 --> 22:29.448
We did it, Patrick!
我们做到了，帕特里克！

22:31.000 --> 22:32.517
President Squidward...
章鱼哥总统...

22:32.689 --> 22:34.931
No, no. Don't
say anything more.
不，不。不要
再说什么。

22:36.275 --> 22:38.655
This was all my fault.
这都是我的错。

22:38.827 --> 22:41.724
I was the one
who wanted to relax on Sunday.
我就是那个
谁想在周日放松一下。

22:41.896 --> 22:44.137
Now, if you'll be so kind
as to leave,
现在，如果你能如此仁慈的话
至于离开，

22:44.310 --> 22:46.793
so I can get ready
for work tomorrow.
这样我就可以做好准备
为了明天的工作。

22:46.965 --> 22:47.965
Mr. President...
总统先生...

22:48.034 --> 22:49.310
Shush.
嘘。

22:49.482 --> 22:50.655
But we just
wanted to...
但我们只是
想要...

22:50.827 --> 22:52.896
Get out of my house!
滚出我家！

22:52.965 --> 22:54.034
Huh?
啊？

22:54.206 --> 22:55.655
There
he is!
那里
他是！

22:55.827 --> 22:57.448
Are you the owner
of this house?
你是业主吗
这所房子的？

22:57.620 --> 22:59.655
Yes! Yes, I am!
是的！我是！

22:59.827 --> 23:01.172
Then on behalf
那么代表

23:01.344 --> 23:02.793
of the citizens
of Bikini Bottom,
公民的
比基尼泳裤，

23:02.965 --> 23:04.586
I present you
with this summons
我向你介绍
有了这个传票

23:04.758 --> 23:06.827
to pay for the destruction
of our town.
支付毁坏费用
我们镇的。

23:07.000 --> 23:09.965
You'll be doing community
service every Sunday
你会做社区
每周日服务

23:10.137 --> 23:11.310
for the rest of your life.
为你的余生。

23:11.517 --> 23:12.896
Huh?
啊？

23:12.965 --> 23:14.862
Squidward, you got
one of those, too?
章鱼哥，你有
也是其中之一吗？

23:15.034 --> 23:16.448
This will be great--
这会很棒——

23:16.620 --> 23:18.965
the three of us cleaning up
Bikini Bottom.
我们三个人打扫卫生
比基尼下装。

23:19.137 --> 23:21.965
Well, see you next Sunday,
President Squidward.
嗯，下周日见
章鱼哥总统。

23:26.793 --> 23:30.103
